  <p>The Stringpullers are a speculated villain group operating in the Fort.</p>

  <h2>Known Members</h2>
  <h3>The leader?</h3>
  <p>Nothing is known about the Stringpullers' leader.</p>
  <h3>Heavyhitter</h3>
  <p>Heavyhitter has some form of super strength. She wields a metal baseball bat and sledgehammer.</p>
  <p>Heavyhitter wears a yellow hard hat and black mask covering her mouth, and a khaki one piece costume.</p>
  <p>It's unconfirmed whether Heavyhitter is a member of the Stringpullers or simply a mercenary who works with them.</p>
  <div class="warning">
    Editor note: It is also unconfirmed if the Stringpullers are even a genuine villain group.
